 ### Offset Regularization
-Regularization for the offset loss with strength $\lambda_\delta$. Typical value is 0.1. If $\lambda_\delta = 0$, the PCN fails to predict correctly by over-relying on offsets. If $\lambda_\delta$ is too large, it over-relies on palette colors, resulting in less accurate reconstruction. [S9]
