 ### Loss Term Configuration
-Specifically regarding entropy loss ($L_{entr}$). Without $L_{entr}$, the separation between static and dynamic radiance becomes ambiguous. $L_{entr}$ encourages static and dynamic radiance separation, improving object renderings and scene decomposition. [S10]
